OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's alcohol deaths are
OL,4,Aincreasing - my daughter died after
OL,5,Afighting for decades
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of women who died last year
OL,8,Fin Scotland from alcohol-related
OL,9,Fillnesses was up by 3% on the year
OL,10,Fbefore, official figures show.
OL,12,FOverall, the total number of people who
OL,13,Fdied from alcohol-related conditions
OL,14,Ffell slightly, to the lowest rate since
OL,15,Fthe pandemic. There were 1,152
OL,16,Falcohol-specific deaths registered in
OL,17,FScotland, a decrease of 3% compared
OL,18,Fwith 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
