OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's alcohol deaths are
OL,4,Aincreasing - my daughter died after
OL,5,Afighting for decades
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government said the drop
OL,8,Famounted to progress and that it would
OL,9,Finvest #160m this year on alcohol and
OL,10,Fdrugs programmes.
OL,12,FBut one mother from Aberdeen whose
OL,13,Fdaughter died alone after decades
OL,14,Ffighting alcoholism described her
OL,15,Fillness as "relentless" and said
OL,16,Fsometimes all the resources available
OL,17,Fare still not enough to beat it.
